  "Starts ({tz})": ["시작 ({tz})", "Début ({tz})", "Mulai ({tz})"],
  "Status": ["상태", "Statut", "Status"],
  "Status for {name}": ["{name}의 상태", "Statut de {name}", "Status {name}"],
  "Status is one of: in_game_confirmed, cross_checked, single_source, conflicting, missing. Level can be a number or TG1–TG6. A blank cost means not recorded, not zero. Every row is checked first; if any row fails, nothing is saved.": ["상태 값: in_game_confirmed, cross_checked, single_source, conflicting, missing. 레벨은 숫자 또는 TG1–TG6입니다. 빈 비용은 0이 아니라 기록 없음입니다. 모든 행을 먼저 검사하며, 한 행이라도 실패하면 아무것도 저장되지 않습니다.", "Statut possible : in_game_confirmed, cross_checked, single_source, conflicting, missing. Le niveau peut être un nombre ou TG1–TG6. Un coût vide signifie non renseigné, pas zéro. Chaque ligne est vérifiée d'abord ; si une ligne échoue, rien n'est enregistré.", "Status salah satu dari: in_game_confirmed, cross_checked, single_source, conflicting, missing. Level bisa angka atau TG1–TG6. Biaya kosong berarti belum dicatat, bukan nol. Setiap baris dicek dulu; jika ada yang gagal, tidak ada yang disimpan."],
