  "Run King's appointment schedules and assign members": ["왕의 임명 일정 운영 및 멤버 배정", "Gérer les plannings de nominations du Roi et attribuer des membres", "Mengelola jadwal jabatan Raja dan menetapkan anggota"],
  "Schedule copied. Paste it in game chat or Discord.": ["일정을 복사했습니다. 게임 채팅이나 Discord에 붙여 넣으세요.", "Planning copié. Collez-le dans le chat du jeu ou sur Discord.", "Jadwal disalin. Tempel di chat game atau Discord."],
  "Schedule created. Open booking when you are ready.": ["일정을 만들었습니다. 준비되면 예약을 여세요.", "Planning créé. Ouvrez les réservations quand vous êtes prêt.", "Jadwal dibuat. Buka pemesanan saat Anda siap."],
